# Product shell

The tax-docs client is a **clone of Ramp's product app** (`try.ramp.com`), relabeled for CPA document work. Tokens: `.cursor/rules/design-system.mdc`. Interaction/voice: `.cursor/rules/web-ui.mdc`. How the pieces compose: `.cursor/skills/building-product-ui/SKILL.md`.

One layout tree. Markup from `src/client/app/render.ts`. Chrome CSS in `src/client/styles/shell.css`. Do not add a second shell, a React tree, or a page that skips the recipes below.

## Chrome

`.app` is `256px` bone sidebar + white workspace. Optional `298px` right rail on Home only. Settings live in `.sidebar-foot`. Search is `Ctrl+K` → Command K (bone 80% wash, 640×432 white panel, grouped list, Feather search on the right). `.palette[hidden]` must stay `display: none`. Collapse is `.app.is-collapsed` at `--app-sidebar-collapsed-width` (60px). Collapsed header is one slot: the GB mark grows to `--icon-size-brand-collapsed` (28px) and is centered (`justify-content: center` on `.sidebar-head` — the expanded `space-between` must not leak through). The expand control sits absolutely on top of it at `opacity: 0` until `.sidebar-head:hover` or `:focus-within`. Do not stack logo and toggle as two visible rows, and do not leave the expand button `space-between` next to the logo in that rail. Collapsed nav/search/expand icons use `--icon-size-nav-collapsed` 16px; expanded stays `--icon-size-nav` 12px. Expanded brand stays `--icon-size-brand` 20px.

Idle nav is ash on bone. An expanded group is a `4px` hairline wash (`--surface-nav-active`) wrapping parent + children. The current child punches out as a bone chip. Nested rows keep a `12px` `.nav-icon-spacer` so labels line up. Children render only while the group is current. Badges are highlighter pills. Icons are Feather at `--icon-size-nav` 12px expanded (`src/client/app/icons.ts`) — never hand-drawn SVGs. The sidebar brand next to “Tax Docs” is `design-system/gb-favicon.png`, same file as the tab favicon — not a clip-path square.

## Page recipes

| Recipe | Use for | Stack |
|--------|---------|-------|
| **Home** | `/` | Eyebrow greeting, 28px queue title, wash card, `.row-list`, rail of block CTAs + hairline widgets |
| **List** | `/documents`, `/review`, `/clients` | `pageHeader` (title + ash count + secondary + one primary) → underline `.tabs` → `.toolbar` → `.data-table` with dual-line `.entity` cells |
| **Inbox** | `/inbox` | `pageHeader` + `.row-list` (no tabs/table) |
| **Settings** | `/settings` | `pageHeader` → tabs → `.definition-grid` (dt ash / dd ink) inside `.settings-block` |

A new route picks one recipe. Extend `pageHeader` / `tabs` / `toolbar` / `dataTable` / `entityCell` / `renderDocumentRow` — do not fork a lookalike.

## Primitives

Buttons live in `design-system/css/base.css`: primary highlighter `0` radius `40px` (hover inverts to ink), secondary `1px --color-outline`, ghost, `32px` `.icon-btn`. Status is `--color-success` / `--color-warning` / `--color-ash` — never highlighter. Elevation is `1px --color-hairline`, not shadow.

## Anti-patterns

A second sidebar. Marketing-site tokens (ink `#0c0a08`, `6px` buttons, bone canvas). Nav children without the group wash. Current child that stays hairline instead of punching out to bone. Lucide/Heroicons/inline path glyphs. Two primary CTAs. Drop shadows except `--shadow-palette` on Command K. `font-weight: 600`. A page that invents its own header/table instead of the helpers in `render.ts`.
